{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411150","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1241115001:1":{"text":"스몰워터 마을에서 일어난 일 때문에 마음이 아파. 우리가 도와줄 수 있는 일이 없을까?","source_cn":"小水村的遭遇真是令人难过。我们能不能帮忙做点什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8D23931B37CC87C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241115002:1":{"text":"음... 낚시하는 걸 도와줄까? 아니면 밭을 갈아줄까?","source_cn":"唔……帮大家钓鱼？帮忙翻耕农田？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC36C8CA1EA87C0F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241115003:1":{"text":"스몰워터 마을에 그런 사소한 도움은 필요 없는 것 같아...","source_cn":"我觉得小水村需要的不是这么浅显的帮助……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x995CA0E4D782CB92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241115004:1":{"text":"그녀들에게는 공정과 질서가 필요하고, 감정의 골을 메워 과거를 극복해야 해. 우리가 도와줄 수 있을까?","source_cn":"她们需要公平与秩序，需要弥合嫌隙，修复过往。不知道我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2B58B0F3349F8C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}